{"t": 1794115024.705038, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`.\n\n**Production error:** Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (2,940 events, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2). Android keyboard input was adding surrounding/inner spaces and lower-case.\n\n**Change:** `normalize_code` now removes all whitespace (surrounding and inner) and upper-cases the code before lookup:\n\n```python\n\"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\n**Verification:** `' autumn24 '`, `'  AU TUMN 24 '`, `'Autumn24'`, and tab/newline-padded variants all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n\nNote: the change is in the local checkout working tree (`checkout/promo.py`); no GitHub repository for this service was reachable, so it has not been pushed/PR'd.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
